# Cloudflare Pages headers.
# Revalidate every file so CSS/HTML updates appear immediately (no stale styling).
# max-age=0 + must-revalidate means the browser re-checks with an ETag each time; if nothing
# changed it gets a fast 304, so this stays cheap while never serving an outdated file.
/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
